      "writtenOn": "2021-12-16T01:32:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Technically protected/exported symbol lists are dependencies; but not all ACK repos have the android directory with those symbol lists. Since CONFIG_SIG_PROTECT is enabled by default for gki_defconfig; I still want those kernel to build as an individual code. Having FORCE and script generating empty header files if symbol lists are not present achieves this.",
