      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e not all ACK repos have the android directory...\nkernel/Makefile is in the same kernel tree/repo as the android directory, so how could there ever be a case where this is present and enabled but the android directory isn\u0027t? Why generate the empty header files (and then build the dependent objects) if we know they are up-to-date?",
